WEBVTT

00:07.460 --> 00:09.460
<b>How did we end up in this situation?!</b>

00:10.000 --> 00:10.790
<b>How?!</b>

00:13.710 --> 00:16.170
<b>Are there any clothes for me to change into?</b>

00:16.380 --> 00:18.040
<b>Y-yes! I went and got some!</b>

00:19.960 --> 00:21.290
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:29.330 --> 00:30.040
<b>So...</b>

00:30.040 --> 00:30.920
<b>Pardon me!</b>

00:36.210 --> 00:37.710
<b>It's not a big deal.</b>

00:38.920 --> 00:40.960
<b>I just need to act like everything's normal between us.</b>

00:41.250 --> 00:43.710
<b>Feel free to use the bed, Ms. Syr.</b>

00:44.130 --> 00:46.750
<b>I don't have a problem with sleeping on the floor.</b>

00:48.130 --> 00:50.040
<b>Whoa! Why aren't you wearing pants?!</b>

00:50.040 --> 00:53.880
<b>I tried to wear them, but I had trouble.
They were too baggy.</b>

00:55.170 --> 00:56.080
<b>And kept falling down.</b>

01:00.080 --> 01:03.880
<b>Seidr</b>

01:00.080 --> 01:03.880
<b>God and Girl</b>

01:01.580 --> 01:03.420
<b>So, uh, like I said...</b>

01:03.790 --> 01:05.420
<b>I'll just sleep on the floor.</b>

01:05.710 --> 01:07.170
<b>Please take the bed, Ms. Syr.</b>

01:07.170 --> 01:09.290
<b>No way. We'll both sleep in the bed.</b>

01:10.040 --> 01:10.920
<b>I can't do that.</b>

01:11.130 --> 01:12.000
<b>Why?</b>

01:13.330 --> 01:14.710
<b>Because I just can't.</b>

01:15.830 --> 01:17.000
<b>No matter what?</b>

01:18.710 --> 01:20.670
<b>Goddess Hestia will get upset with me.</b>

01:21.170 --> 01:23.790
<b>But if I take the bed all for myself...</b>

01:24.460 --> 01:26.670
<b>then I might just die from the overwhelming guilt.</b>

01:27.580 --> 01:28.960
<b>There you go lying again.</b>

01:36.130 --> 01:37.250
<b>Would you care to take a seat?</b>

01:49.880 --> 01:52.250
<b>You're really not going to do anything for me?</b>

01:53.040 --> 01:57.250
<b>Wh-what is that supposed to mean? I don't get it.</b>

02:11.210 --> 02:14.170
<b>So, uh, Ms. Syr? I was wondering...</b>

02:14.630 --> 02:18.710
<b>What made you ask me out on this date?</b>

02:20.920 --> 02:23.000
<b>Because I wanted to express my feelings for you.</b>

02:24.330 --> 02:25.080
<b>No.</b>

02:26.210 --> 02:27.540
<b>Because I wanted to prove them.</b>

02:33.040 --> 02:34.500
<b>I needed to be sure.</b>

02:35.290 --> 02:36.580
<b>That what I'm feeling...</b>

02:37.920 --> 02:40.380
<b>is really love. Or not.</b>

02:42.830 --> 02:43.500
<b>Stop!</b>

02:49.330 --> 02:50.880
<b>This isn't right.</b>

02:51.790 --> 02:54.790
<b>Getting swept up in the moment
will just hurt both of us in the end...</b>

02:56.000 --> 02:57.250
<b>Don't reject me.</b>

02:58.750 --> 02:59.920
<b>Accept my feelings.</b>

03:06.670 --> 03:07.670
<b>Ms. Syr...</b>

03:09.380 --> 03:11.210
<b>No! I can't!</b>

03:11.580 --> 03:14.420
<b>This is wrong! It's not who I am!</b>

03:15.380 --> 03:18.000
<b>Please don't look at me! Look away!</b>

03:18.540 --> 03:19.750
<b>I'm begging you!</b>

03:26.630 --> 03:28.790
<b>Are you disillusioned with me now?</b>

03:29.540 --> 03:30.250
<b>No.</b>

03:34.500 --> 03:35.580
<b>So, I'm curious...</b>

03:36.080 --> 03:37.920
<b>Don't you have any desire for a lover?</b>

03:37.920 --> 03:39.500
<b>What kind of question is that?!</b>

03:43.790 --> 03:46.130
<b>Hey, you promised you wouldn't do anything...</b>

03:46.500 --> 03:48.210
<b>Let me get closer. I'm cold.</b>

03:48.460 --> 03:49.630
<b>B-but...</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:52.080
<b>You didn't have any trouble snuggling with Ryu.</b>

03:53.960 --> 03:55.710
<b>Did you hear about that from her?</b>

03:56.170 --> 03:56.960
<b>Nope.</b>

03:57.580 --> 04:00.290
<b>But your reaction just now told me everything.</b>

04:02.540 --> 04:05.000
<b>You know Ryu is someone special to me.</b>

04:05.920 --> 04:08.210
<b>But you did naughty things with her anyway, didn't you?</b>

04:08.380 --> 04:09.830
<b>Th-th-that's not what happened!</b>

04:10.380 --> 04:11.540
<b>I did no such thing!</b>

04:11.830 --> 04:12.830
<b>Really?</b>

04:13.130 --> 04:13.880
<b>Really.</b>

04:14.420 --> 04:16.630
<b>Then you won't do anything naughty to me, either, huh?</b>

04:16.630 --> 04:17.960
<b>N-no, I won't.</b>

04:18.420 --> 04:19.460
<b>Why not?</b>

04:20.000 --> 04:21.380
<b>Well, I mean...</b>

04:28.080 --> 04:30.960
<b>It's because you're you, Ms. Syr.</b>

04:31.580 --> 04:32.630
<b>I can't do it.</b>

04:36.040 --> 04:38.790
<b>You jerk. You big, fat jerk.</b>

04:39.380 --> 04:41.670
<b>Jerk. Jerk.</b>

04:43.790 --> 04:45.630
<b>You know we can't all be alike.</b>

04:46.330 --> 04:48.920
<b>I'm not okay being the same as Ryu and everybody else.</b>

04:49.710 --> 04:50.710
<b>What do you mean?</b>

04:51.830 --> 04:54.250
<b>You're too much of a kid to understand.</b>

04:55.960 --> 04:57.710
<b>I don't even understand it, myself.</b>

04:58.710 --> 05:00.880
<b>Where is this desperation coming from?</b>

05:01.710 --> 05:03.540
<b>To keep it from falling out of my hands...</b>

05:04.130 --> 05:08.420
<b>Obsessing, striving, and hoping...</b>

05:09.460 --> 05:10.920
<b>Ah, I get it now.</b>

05:11.920 --> 05:16.290
<b>That's why... I fell... for you...</b>

05:46.960 --> 05:47.880
<b>Ms. Syr?!</b>

05:52.630 --> 05:54.420
<b>So, how'd that date of yours go?</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:56.880
<b>We were worried since you never came back.</b>

05:57.250 --> 05:59.290
<b>What about you, Welf? What's with the getup?</b>

06:01.080 --> 06:04.670
<b>All of us got roped into working here
during the Goddess Festival.</b>

06:05.710 --> 06:07.330
<b>But let's get back to you.</b>

06:08.210 --> 06:09.250
<b>Well, actually...</b>

06:10.920 --> 06:15.250
<b>You two got chased around by the Freya Familia
and she was gone by the time you woke up?</b>

06:15.960 --> 06:20.130
<b>Yeah. So I figured she might have
just gone back to the tavern.</b>

06:20.790 --> 06:25.080
<b>Well, I was stuck here all night and I didn't see
any sign of her coming back whatsoever.</b>

06:25.830 --> 06:26.540
<b>Darn...</b>

06:27.000 --> 06:30.380
<b>Hold up. What are you planning to do once you find her?</b>

06:31.630 --> 06:32.920
<b>Why are you asking?</b>

06:33.460 --> 06:38.250
<b>From what you've told me, it seems pretty obvious
that she's head over heels about you.</b>

06:38.670 --> 06:41.130
<b>So that begs the question:
What will you do when you find her?</b>

06:41.920 --> 06:45.830
<b>Are you just gonna play dumb and let things
go back to normal between you two?</b>

06:47.460 --> 06:49.580
<b>It's cruel not to give her a clear answer, man.</b>

06:50.290 --> 06:51.580
<b>Even I know that much.</b>

06:52.170 --> 06:54.080
<b>If you choose to keep up the "dense fool" act,</b>

06:54.290 --> 06:56.250
<b>then you're gonna lose all my respect.</b>

06:57.960 --> 06:59.330
<b>It's okay to be modest.</b>

06:59.790 --> 07:03.080
<b>And I get that it's easy to feel helpless
when you lack self-confidence.</b>

07:03.790 --> 07:06.670
<b>But don't cut and run from someone
who poured their heart out to you.</b>

07:08.040 --> 07:10.790
<b>I want you to stay a straight shooter
who takes care of business.</b>

07:11.670 --> 07:13.330
<b>Although that's just me being selfish.</b>

07:15.380 --> 07:18.080
<b>Thanks. I'll have a real talk with Ms. Syr.</b>

07:18.710 --> 07:20.750
<b>But I'm going to have to find her first.</b>

07:21.580 --> 07:23.710
<b>Sorry, man. Didn't mean to lecture you.</b>

07:24.040 --> 07:24.790
<b>Nah.</b>

07:25.330 --> 07:26.710
<b>I'm the one who should say sorry.</b>

07:28.670 --> 07:32.670
<b>I'm betting the best chance you have of finding her
is to get in contact with the Freya Familia directly.</b>

07:33.170 --> 07:34.710
<b>Wish I could help, but...</b>

07:35.710 --> 07:38.000
<b>there's no escaping from that Dwarf.</b>

07:44.130 --> 07:47.880
<b>The Freya Familia's lookouts have all but disappeared.</b>

07:48.830 --> 07:52.040
<b>Finding Master Hedin and asking him
about Ms. Syr would be nice, but...</b>

07:59.750 --> 08:01.290
<b>The wind is weeping.</b>

08:03.630 --> 08:06.250
<b>You're a first-class adventurer with the Freya Familia.</b>

08:06.710 --> 08:09.170
<b>Mr. Hogni Ragnar, right?</b>

08:09.710 --> 08:13.080
<b>What business have you here? My unhonored guest.</b>

08:13.460 --> 08:18.080
<b>Unless you covet being embroiled in a banquet
of madness, then be gone forthwith.</b>

08:21.000 --> 08:22.830
<b>Wait, are you...</b>

08:23.290 --> 08:25.960
<b>the guy the Gods dubbed "cringe-infected"
for speaking with big words?</b>

08:26.460 --> 08:28.330
<b>Do not mention that abhorrent name!</b>

08:28.460 --> 08:30.500
<b>I am infected by no such blight!</b>

08:30.500 --> 08:31.750
<b>S-sorry.</b>

08:33.460 --> 08:35.580
<b>Please quit looking at me like that.</b>

08:35.880 --> 08:39.290
<b>This is the worst first encounter ever!
So humiliating! I wanna die!</b>

08:39.790 --> 08:42.580
<b>My persona of dark intrigue is withering away...</b>

08:43.330 --> 08:46.830
<b>Um, do you happen to know where Ms. Syr went to?</b>

08:49.040 --> 08:52.500
<b>We, too, presently seek the
whereabouts of the holy maiden.</b>

08:52.500 --> 08:56.210
<b>A myriad of my compatriots have
liberated themselves from thine snare,</b>

08:56.210 --> 08:58.790
<b>and now quest for signs of good tidings.</b>

08:59.130 --> 09:02.420
<b>Uh, so... everybody else from the Freya Familia</b>

09:02.420 --> 09:06.750
<b>quit watching me and went to find Ms. Syr instead?</b>

09:08.960 --> 09:12.630
<b>That must mean Mr. Hogni was
left to keep tabs on me just in case.</b>

09:13.000 --> 09:18.250
<b>What of your sublime and eternal memories?
Have you forged the epoch of which shall never fade?</b>

09:18.250 --> 09:18.880
<b>Huh?</b>

09:19.330 --> 09:21.460
<b>There shall be no going of separate ways.</b>

09:21.670 --> 09:25.920
<b>Thus, I am asking if you have made
ready by exchanging your farewells.</b>

09:26.210 --> 09:27.920
<b>Memories? Farewell?</b>

09:27.920 --> 09:29.210
<b>I don't know what you mean.</b>

09:29.670 --> 09:32.830
<b>Twas the girl and not the Goddess who courted you.</b>

09:33.330 --> 09:39.000
<b>Therefore your destiny shall remain unyielding,
no matter what other choice you try to adopt.</b>

09:39.000 --> 09:42.210
<b>What does that mean? What's so special about Ms. Syr?</b>

09:42.670 --> 09:43.540
<b>What's my destiny?!</b>

09:44.210 --> 09:47.130
<b>S-s-stay back! That look in your eyes scares me!</b>

09:47.580 --> 09:48.500
<b>Oh, screw it.</b>

09:49.330 --> 09:50.210
<b>I'm running away.</b>

09:50.210 --> 09:51.080
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

09:52.960 --> 09:56.000
<b>Farewell? Like I'm leaving?
What is that supposed to mean?</b>

09:56.540 --> 09:58.130
<b>And how does it relate to Ms. Syr?</b>

10:08.170 --> 10:10.500
<b>Please, Hermes!</b>

10:10.790 --> 10:12.960
<b>I'm begging you to help me out!</b>

10:12.960 --> 10:16.670
<b>It's Bell! My precious Bell is nowhere to be found!</b>

10:16.670 --> 10:19.290
<b>Okay, I get it! Just let me go!</b>

10:19.500 --> 10:22.040
<b>I already sent Asfi to look for him from the skies!</b>

10:24.040 --> 10:28.580
<b>Wah! I need Bell! My precious Bell!</b>

10:27.130 --> 10:28.880
<b>My apologies, Master Hermes.</b>

10:30.750 --> 10:34.500
<b>It's all right. I've been concerned about those two, myself.</b>

10:35.170 --> 10:38.460
<b>Although, more so Syr than Bell.</b>

10:40.750 --> 10:43.250
<b>We search fur the whole night and didn't find them.</b>

10:43.630 --> 10:47.250
<b>Just where the heck did Syr and that kid disappurr to?!</b>

10:48.130 --> 10:50.920
<b>Syr and Bell are nowhere to be found...</b>

10:51.210 --> 10:52.790
<b>And they never came home at all...</b>

10:52.790 --> 10:56.290
<b>Hey! Anya caught a whiff of the adventure boy!</b>

10:56.290 --> 10:58.580
<b>He's heading northeast towards
the manufacturing district.</b>

10:58.580 --> 11:00.580
<b>That's amewzing news, Anya!</b>

10:59.420 --> 11:02.830
<b>They spent the night alone together? Until morning?</b>

11:00.880 --> 11:06.790
<b>Yeah, but there was no trace of Syr.
She might've gotten sepurrated from white whiskers.</b>

11:03.080 --> 11:07.420
<b>No way. I don't believe it. This can't be real.</b>

11:06.790 --> 11:08.420
<b>Whatever, let's get on his tail!</b>

11:07.670 --> 11:08.420
<b>They're not even married yet.</b>

11:08.710 --> 11:10.960
<b>C'mon, Ryu. Time to kitten gear.</b>

11:09.130 --> 11:10.960
<b>They have to make vows of love first.</b>

11:11.210 --> 11:13.080
<b>If not in the forest, then at least before a God...</b>

11:13.170 --> 11:14.750
<b>If not in the forest, then at least before a God...</b>

11:13.750 --> 11:16.130
<b>Ugh, enough! Snap the hell out of it!</b>

11:29.540 --> 11:32.210
<b>Oh gosh! I'm so glad to see you again!</b>

11:32.580 --> 11:34.420
<b>You actually came and found me.</b>

11:35.130 --> 11:36.790
<b>Um, about this...</b>

11:40.080 --> 11:42.210
<b>I'm sorry. I was in such a rush I forgot.</b>

11:46.630 --> 11:48.500
<b>I've been waiting the whole time!</b>

11:48.920 --> 11:51.580
<b>Letting this chance slip by would mean
my dream will never come true!</b>

11:51.960 --> 11:52.960
<b>So please!</b>

11:53.540 --> 11:54.920
<b>This is the last time!</b>

11:56.000 --> 11:58.540
<b>Don't reject me. Please.</b>

12:01.290 --> 12:02.540
<b>Dainsleif.</b>

12:09.460 --> 12:10.580
<b>Mr. Hogni...?</b>

12:11.130 --> 12:15.130
<b>What are you plotting?
The White Rabbit belongs to the Goddess.</b>

12:15.330 --> 12:18.000
<b>There is no world where you have the right to infringe.</b>

12:18.420 --> 12:19.960
<b>Mr. Hogni, I was just...</b>

12:19.960 --> 12:22.960
<b>Don't waste your words. I shall extinguish your life.</b>

12:23.580 --> 12:25.420
<b>But why?! Explain yourself!</b>

12:25.420 --> 12:27.130
<b>All in service to my Goddess.</b>

12:46.330 --> 12:49.250
<b>Withdraw, Rabbit! Unless you want my blade to end you!</b>

12:49.460 --> 12:51.580
<b>If I make one mistake, your head comes clean off!</b>

12:52.000 --> 12:54.080
<b>Mr. Hogni isn't aiming for me.</b>

12:54.460 --> 12:56.210
<b>Which means, I can act as a shield!</b>

12:58.580 --> 12:59.580
<b>Irksome.</b>

12:59.580 --> 13:01.000
<b>Yet meaningless.</b>

13:08.580 --> 13:09.460
<b>Ms. Ryu?!</b>

13:09.670 --> 13:13.290
<b>What's going on here?
Why is the Freya Familia attacking you?!</b>

13:13.960 --> 13:17.080
<b>Begone. I'm in the middle of killing that woman.</b>

13:17.380 --> 13:18.830
<b>Huh?! Screw that!</b>

13:18.960 --> 13:21.920
<b>You're acting way too immature
fur an expurrt adventurer!</b>

13:22.170 --> 13:24.210
<b>What's the hold up, Hogni?</b>

13:25.040 --> 13:27.210
<b>It's already clear that woman is a transgressor.</b>

13:27.420 --> 13:30.000
<b>If you're going to keep dawdling, then we'll eliminate her.</b>

13:30.920 --> 13:33.420
<b>Adventurer boy. Take Syr and make a break for it.</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:35.210
<b>We can only stall them for a minute.</b>

13:37.420 --> 13:38.250
<b>Go!</b>

13:49.380 --> 13:50.830
<b>Stay out of this, brethren!</b>

13:54.380 --> 13:56.710
<b>You are another of her cherished ones.</b>

13:56.710 --> 13:58.380
<b>That makes this most arduous!</b>

13:58.540 --> 13:59.920
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

14:02.580 --> 14:03.500
<b>I can avoid it!</b>

14:12.130 --> 14:14.750
<b>My beloved blade, Victim Abyss.</b>

14:14.960 --> 14:17.460
<b>Or as I call it: the Vanguard Slayer.</b>

14:23.960 --> 14:24.790
<b>Meow?</b>

14:25.500 --> 14:26.330
<b>Chloe...</b>

14:26.920 --> 14:27.880
<b>Lunor...</b>

14:28.920 --> 14:29.750
<b>Ryu!</b>

14:31.250 --> 14:33.790
<b>Are you still going to resist, Vana Alfi?</b>

14:34.920 --> 14:36.830
<b>I don't go by that name anymeowr!</b>

14:37.080 --> 14:38.630
<b>I'm just Anya to mew!</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:42.790
<b>Leave Syr alone. I won't stand fur
anybody hurting my family!</b>

14:43.170 --> 14:45.170
<b>Whaddya think you're doing, goofus?</b>

14:48.000 --> 14:50.500
<b>B-big brother?! Why are you here?</b>

14:50.710 --> 14:53.460
<b>Don't reply with a question! I'm the one asking YOU here!</b>

14:53.710 --> 14:54.880
<b>Oh, I'm sorry!</b>

14:55.130 --> 14:57.920
<b>We were kitten into a fight cuz
my friends and I want to purrtect Syr...</b>

14:57.920 --> 14:59.830
<b>Quit talking like you're a damn clown!</b>

15:02.330 --> 15:05.250
<b>How many times do I have to say it before
it gets through your thick friggin' skull?</b>

15:05.460 --> 15:07.460
<b>You really piss me the hell off!</b>

15:07.790 --> 15:10.500
<b>I'm sorry... I just...</b>

15:11.000 --> 15:12.290
<b>Get lost. Right now.</b>

15:12.540 --> 15:13.540
<b>You're a nuisance!</b>

15:15.210 --> 15:16.960
<b>Wait! Please wait!</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:21.000
<b>Listen, Big Brother! I don't care what
happens to me, just please let Syr go!</b>

15:21.000 --> 15:21.790
<b>Shut up.</b>

15:46.920 --> 15:51.380
<b>Please help me understand!
Why would the Freya Familia be trying to kill you?!</b>

15:51.880 --> 15:55.000
<b>It's all because Lady Freya fell in love
with you at first sight, Mr. Bell.</b>

15:55.000 --> 15:57.540
<b>Even though I knew she wanted to keep you for herself,</b>

15:57.790 --> 16:00.460
<b>I'm trying to steal you away right now!</b>

16:01.250 --> 16:05.710
<b>What's going on here, Hermes?
What is that girl supposed to be? It's hard to tell!</b>

16:07.540 --> 16:10.250
<b>Is she really... a fellow Goddess?</b>

16:16.210 --> 16:18.670
<b>I've been granted just this one chance.</b>

16:19.540 --> 16:22.880
<b>I submitted to my impulses and
made a decision in the face of divine will.</b>

16:23.330 --> 16:24.670
<b>So I can't talk my way out of it.</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:27.960
<b>And they definitely won't spare me.</b>

16:28.790 --> 16:31.750
<b>But... none of that changes how I feel!</b>

16:32.330 --> 16:33.170
<b>Mr. Bell!</b>

16:35.710 --> 16:38.710
<b>I don't care if it's out of kindness. Or even just pity.</b>

16:39.500 --> 16:41.380
<b>All I want is for you to accept my feelings.</b>

16:41.630 --> 16:42.500
<b>Please!</b>

16:46.210 --> 16:48.080
<b>What are you doing, Mr. Bell?</b>

16:48.880 --> 16:52.330
<b>I knew from the moment
we met up earlier. You're not her.</b>

16:53.210 --> 16:54.330
<b>Who are you, really?</b>

16:58.580 --> 17:01.830
<b>How can you say that, Mr. Bell? I'm who I've always been.</b>

17:02.290 --> 17:03.460
<b>Syr Flover!</b>

17:03.880 --> 17:06.250
<b>You didn't hesitate to fight and protect me earlier, right?</b>

17:06.710 --> 17:10.130
<b>Yeah. Because I had no idea what was going on.</b>

17:10.540 --> 17:12.460
<b>And I didn't want anyone to die.</b>

17:12.960 --> 17:15.420
<b>No matter... who you actually turned out to be.</b>

17:16.250 --> 17:19.500
<b>That barrette has the Knight on it. It's my half.</b>

17:20.420 --> 17:23.460
<b>The real Syr still has the other half with the Spirit on it.</b>

17:24.290 --> 17:27.420
<b>I'm guessing you know everything
there is to know about Syr.</b>

17:27.790 --> 17:29.210
<b>But not perfectly.</b>

17:29.580 --> 17:31.130
<b>That's why I asked. So tell me.</b>

17:31.710 --> 17:34.000
<b>Who are you?</b>

17:35.380 --> 17:37.790
<b>I can't believe my cover was blown from the very start.</b>

17:38.170 --> 17:39.960
<b>Talk about hopelessly foolish.</b>

17:41.670 --> 17:45.380
<b>If only you never noticed,
then you would have fallen into a sweet embrace...</b>

17:45.710 --> 17:48.790
<b>and earned yourself a quick death at my mercy!</b>

17:52.750 --> 17:54.630
<b>I've lost this gamble of mine.</b>

17:55.080 --> 17:55.960
<b>You're free to go.</b>

17:56.580 --> 17:58.920
<b>Lady Syr is over in the south gardens.</b>

18:00.040 --> 18:01.630
<b>But what are you going to do?</b>

18:02.000 --> 18:04.040
<b>Mr. Hogni and the others are out to kill you.</b>

18:04.670 --> 18:07.540
<b>You're still worried despite knowing that I'm an imposter?</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:10.830
<b>Just how badly are you trying to immiserate me?</b>

18:11.540 --> 18:13.750
<b>You really are the worst kind of hypocrite.</b>

18:14.670 --> 18:16.750
<b>Please leave. Now.</b>

18:26.250 --> 18:28.000
<b>What is it that you desire?</b>

18:32.630 --> 18:34.750
<b>I want to become you.</b>

18:35.460 --> 18:37.000
<b>I want to quit being me</b>

18:37.210 --> 18:40.670
<b>and become the beautiful and warm person that you are.</b>

18:42.080 --> 18:43.040
<b>What's your name?</b>

18:43.420 --> 18:44.290
<b>Syr.</b>

18:45.170 --> 18:45.920
<b>Okay.</b>

18:46.880 --> 18:48.540
<b>Then give me your name.</b>

18:49.460 --> 18:52.040
<b>And I'll give you one of mine in exchange.</b>

18:53.710 --> 18:56.210
<b>From now on, you'll be a daughter of the Gods.</b>

18:56.750 --> 18:57.880
<b>And your name is...</b>

19:03.580 --> 19:07.920
<b>Going solo to pull this bullshit.
What the hell were you even hoping to accomplish?</b>

19:08.290 --> 19:09.960
<b>Let's hear it, Horn!</b>

19:11.670 --> 19:13.710
<b>You're a poor excuse of an assistant.</b>

19:19.790 --> 19:21.920
<b>This ruse of yours has gone far too smoothly.</b>

19:22.080 --> 19:25.000
<b>Admit it. You ensnared Ottarl and
the others in this, didn't you?</b>

19:29.080 --> 19:30.540
<b>I have no excuse.</b>

19:30.920 --> 19:33.250
<b>I went against her divine will and I...</b>

19:33.710 --> 19:35.420
<b>tried to murder Bell Cranel.</b>

19:36.290 --> 19:39.540
<b>Yeah, and you meant to get killed
by us all along, didn't you?</b>

19:39.920 --> 19:43.670
<b>Forcing her to deal with this crap
all for your own rotten self-satisfaction.</b>

19:44.580 --> 19:46.920
<b>You think this was about self-satisfaction?</b>

19:48.000 --> 19:50.210
<b>You can't even begin to grasp the reality.</b>

19:50.580 --> 19:55.330
<b>Because I can become one with her.
Our psyches overlap with each other.</b>

19:55.830 --> 19:57.710
<b>So it's impossible for you to understand!</b>

19:58.330 --> 20:00.460
<b>I was driven by one fear.</b>

20:00.460 --> 20:04.040
<b>The fear that my Goddess would be forever
changed with that man around.</b>

20:04.250 --> 20:07.420
<b>If things carried on between them,
then my one and only Queen would be tainted,</b>

20:07.420 --> 20:08.920
<b>and fall into depravity!</b>

20:09.420 --> 20:11.500
<b>That's why I had no choice but to act!</b>

20:12.000 --> 20:16.130
<b>Even if she was opposed to it!
Even if she shunned me forever!</b>

20:16.750 --> 20:19.540
<b>I was ready to kill him for her sake!</b>

20:20.500 --> 20:22.580
<b>It was a necessary sin!</b>

20:23.580 --> 20:26.290
<b>Because a Goddess must remain a Goddess!</b>

20:27.170 --> 20:30.540
<b>Letting her sink to the level of
some generic girl defies all reason!</b>

20:36.500 --> 20:39.170
<b>You're nothing but a friggin' zealot.</b>

20:55.040 --> 20:57.460
<b>I'm flattered you found me, Mr. Bell.</b>

20:58.500 --> 21:01.290
<b>Well, a person who looks exactly
like you said you'd be here.</b>

21:01.540 --> 21:06.830
<b>Silly! You're supposed to reply with something
more charming like: "my heart told me you'd be here."</b>

21:09.710 --> 21:11.540
<b>Why did you do all of this?</b>

21:12.290 --> 21:13.790
<b>It's like I told you yesterday.</b>

21:14.460 --> 21:16.000
<b>I wanted to express my feelings for you.</b>

21:17.380 --> 21:19.500
<b>And to find out whether I was in love or not.</b>

21:20.130 --> 21:22.500
<b>I figured that no matter what
feelings you have for other girls,</b>

21:20.790 --> 21:23.420
<b>This secret sinks</b>

21:23.000 --> 21:25.330
<b>if you actually went out of your way to find me,</b>

21:23.420 --> 21:25.880
<b>Into the undulating water's surface</b>

21:26.080 --> 21:28.540
<b>that I would get to feel a little smug about it.</b>

21:26.290 --> 21:30.460
<b>There was apparently enough room to notice</b>

21:29.330 --> 21:31.960
<b>I hated the idea of letting time go
by without doing anything.</b>

21:31.290 --> 21:37.920
<b>Though unable to express them clearly, my pure-white feelings</b>

21:32.670 --> 21:34.630
<b>So I made my affections clear.</b>

21:35.460 --> 21:39.250
<b>Except... I realized part of me
prefers a slow burn romance.</b>

21:37.920 --> 21:41.080
<b>Once again become desires when called out</b>

21:40.290 --> 21:43.670
<b>Then I started to become unsure of myself
and what I really wanted.</b>

21:41.080 --> 21:46.080
<b>These eager emotions surge just like waves</b>

21:44.710 --> 21:48.330
<b>And now, I'm sure the only way
I can be free from this torment</b>

21:46.460 --> 21:51.670
<b>Swelling up unknowingly with a gentle tingle</b>

21:49.540 --> 21:52.210
<b>is by laying all my feelings on the table.</b>

21:52.790 --> 21:59.330
<b>And after the wall dividing us crumbled, the words I understood</b>

21:52.880 --> 21:54.380
<b>I finally figured it out.</b>

21:56.920 --> 21:58.580
<b>I'm crazy about you, Mr. Bell.</b>

21:59.330 --> 22:03.170
<b>You're the love of my life.
I want to spend forever with you.</b>

21:59.630 --> 22:03.380
<b>Simply float unsteadily in the sky</b>

22:03.920 --> 22:05.750
<b>And I really want you to choose me.</b>

22:04.290 --> 22:09.830
<b>I want a love that grows bountiful even if it's empty</b>

22:06.830 --> 22:09.790
<b>My heart aches. I yearn for you to hold me.</b>

22:10.080 --> 22:15.290
<b>If this is a dream I might as well take the lies out, too</b>

22:10.500 --> 22:13.040
<b>I'm so sick of agonizing over what tomorrow has in store.</b>

22:13.500 --> 22:15.580
<b>I never even wanted to experience this.</b>

22:15.290 --> 22:19.040
<b>Even a life that cannot be stolen</b>

22:16.170 --> 22:19.750
<b>But all the same, I want to know
where these feelings take me...</b>

22:19.250 --> 22:24.630
<b>Changes the heart by filling it a little</b>

22:20.290 --> 22:21.880
<b>I can't help but be curious!</b>

22:23.460 --> 22:26.580
<b>I love you... Bell.</b>

22:24.920 --> 22:30.580
<b>An innocent mist that's like a dizzy spell</b>

22:35.420 --> 22:36.420
<b>I had no idea.</b>

22:38.380 --> 22:40.750
<b>Turning away someone's love...</b>

22:41.290 --> 22:44.420
<b>really tears you apart inside.</b>

22:49.790 --> 22:50.630
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

23:09.880 --> 23:12.250
<b>Ottarl. Make the preparations.</b>

23:12.580 --> 23:14.380
<b>I'm going to take him for myself.</b>

23:15.170 --> 23:16.540
<b>Are you absolutely sure?</b>

23:17.710 --> 23:20.130
<b>I'm finished with being the girl.</b>

23:21.250 --> 23:22.960
<b>Syr is dead now.</b>

23:23.540 --> 23:26.040
<b>I should have just done it this way from the start.</b>

23:28.210 --> 23:31.130
<b>I won't let anyone else have you, Bell.</b>

23:31.500 --> 23:34.420
<b>Soon enough you'll belong to me, and me alone.</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Freya Familia</b>

23:36.090 --> 23:41.040
<b>Invasion</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:39.420
<b>Next time: "Freya Familia".</b>
